@startuml Hermes记忆机制嫁接xinyu架构图
title Hermes记忆机制嫁接xinyu架构图（实线为现有，虚线为设计提案）

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

component "Agent\n例如xingmeng-content-agent" as Agent
component "MCP工具层" as MCP

package "xinyu现有记忆架构" {
  component "短期记忆\nPostgreSQL 40轮原文" as ShortMem
  component "长期记忆\nPolarDB向量引擎" as LongMem
  component "用户画像\nPolarDB Profile" as Profile
  component "MemorySummaryProcessor\n被动总结与合并" as Summarizer
}

package "嫁接提案 借鉴Hermes Agent 尚未实现" {
  component "记忆快照锁定机制\n嫁接点1" as Snapshot
  component "角色记忆自主策展\n嫁接点2" as Curator
  component "写入读取双重安全扫描\n嫁接点3" as SecurityScan
  component "mem0图谱记忆后端\n嫁接点4" as GraphBackend
}

Agent --> MCP : 现有
MCP --> ShortMem : 现有
MCP --> LongMem : 现有
MCP --> Profile : 现有
Summarizer --> LongMem : 现有 定时写入

Snapshot ..> MCP : 提案 会话开始时锁定读取快照
Curator ..> Agent : 提案 生成前主动整理记忆
SecurityScan ..> Summarizer : 提案 写入前扫描
SecurityScan ..> MCP : 提案 读取前扫描
GraphBackend ..> MCP : 提案 作为第二记忆后端接入

note right of Snapshot
  借鉴Hermes记忆延迟生效设计
  保护Prompt Cache命中率
end note

note right of GraphBackend
  借鉴Hermes可插拔记忆Provider生态
  用mem0图谱能力补齐多人关系推理短板
end note

@enduml
